            <div xml:id="d155">

                <pb facs="0320" n="204" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg204"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 793.94/417.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Chinese Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 10, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge, with
                    thanks, the receipt of your note of July 6th, inclosing a copy of an official
                    statement by the Chinese Government respecting the recent negotiations with
                    Japan, and also a copy of the treaties and annexes resulting from those
                    negotiations.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
